WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.923
- All right, welcome back!

00:00:01.923 --> 00:00:04.380
I don't know about you, but
I find it highly unlikely

00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:06.690
that we're the only intelligent
life in the universe.

00:00:06.690 --> 00:00:08.310
I mean, it's just
egocentric to think that.

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:09.891
Like, it's like, come on.

00:00:09.891 --> 00:00:11.370
But if you do, great,

00:00:11.370 --> 00:00:12.503
you can believe in whatever you want.

00:00:12.503 --> 00:00:13.336
(audience laugh)

00:00:13.336 --> 00:00:14.220
And it's a conversation

00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:16.470
that's come up often with guests here.

00:00:16.470 --> 00:00:18.720
So who's a believer in aliens?

00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:19.562
Anybody who believe in aliens?

00:00:19.562 --> 00:00:20.550
(crowd cheers loudly)

00:00:20.550 --> 00:00:21.870
Who is not a believer in aliens?

00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:23.470
You just said, "Me, me, me, me."

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:29.370
Okay, so y'all are
wrong, but I don't know.

00:00:29.370 --> 00:00:32.070
Find out though, in this little mashup.

00:00:32.070 --> 00:00:34.140
Do you believe in UFOs or aliens?

00:00:34.140 --> 00:00:34.973
- Absolutely.

00:00:34.973 --> 00:00:36.660
- Okay. I believe that
anything could exist.

00:00:36.660 --> 00:00:37.493
I don't know.

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:41.130
- Whoa. These come from outer space.

00:00:41.130 --> 00:00:43.423
They have big, black eyes.
- Aliens.

00:00:43.423 --> 00:00:44.430
I think there's gotta be aliens.

00:00:44.430 --> 00:00:45.973
I just think it's not what we think it is.

00:00:45.973 --> 00:00:46.806
- Yeah. I don't-
- I think there's other

00:00:46.806 --> 00:00:47.639
life forms, but it's not
gonna be like what we-

00:00:47.639 --> 00:00:48.480
- I agree.

00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:49.313
You know, like in the movies.

00:00:49.313 --> 00:00:51.690
- And there's absolutely other life forms.

00:00:51.690 --> 00:00:54.030
- If aliens came during COVID,

00:00:54.030 --> 00:00:55.560
and if the first place they visited,

00:00:55.560 --> 00:00:57.332
was your studio during a recording-

00:00:57.332 --> 00:00:58.165
- Yeah.

00:00:58.165 --> 00:01:00.990
- They would think you're the
three dimensional overlord

00:01:00.990 --> 00:01:02.636
over two dimensional people.

00:01:02.636 --> 00:01:04.740
(audience laugh)

00:01:04.740 --> 00:01:06.363
- Couple times, you know, throughout life.

00:01:06.363 --> 00:01:08.100
I've seen some crazy stuff.

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:12.210
And some of it, I'm sure, most
of it's probably explainable,

00:01:12.210 --> 00:01:13.397
but some of it, I like to believe-

00:01:13.397 --> 00:01:15.270
- [Billy] Aye! I took that picture!

00:01:15.270 --> 00:01:16.647
- [Kelly] He said, "Aye!"

00:01:16.647 --> 00:01:19.463
(Kelly laughs)
- [Lisa] Ah. Wow.

00:01:19.463 --> 00:01:20.430
- [Billy] I remember that thing.

00:01:20.430 --> 00:01:22.410
I remember that one right
there. That's a beauty.

00:01:22.410 --> 00:01:23.243
I took that.

00:01:23.243 --> 00:01:24.870
- Do you believe, Lisa,
in extraterrestrials?

00:01:24.870 --> 00:01:26.040
- [Lisa] I do. I do.

00:01:26.040 --> 00:01:27.510
- [Kelly] I don't think
it's what we think it is-

00:01:27.510 --> 00:01:28.343
- I know.

00:01:28.343 --> 00:01:29.490
- But I do believe in other life.

00:01:29.490 --> 00:01:31.920
- I think that just, we
can't be the only life.

00:01:31.920 --> 00:01:33.433
- [Kelly] I think that's so
egocentric to think that.

00:01:33.433 --> 00:01:34.290
- I think so too.

00:01:34.290 --> 00:01:35.850
- [Kelly] Right? I mean,
unless you don't believe in it

00:01:35.850 --> 00:01:37.650
and then I think that's fine, Rainn.

00:01:38.985 --> 00:01:41.520
- [Rainn] No, no. Oh, I totally believe

00:01:41.520 --> 00:01:45.000
that there's aliens, and some kind of,

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:46.951
they'd be traveling and
they'd be observing us.

00:01:46.951 --> 00:01:49.050
And right now, I think those aliens

00:01:49.050 --> 00:01:51.450
are looking down on
Planet Earth and going-

00:01:51.450 --> 00:01:52.373
- [Lisa] Yes.

00:01:52.373 --> 00:01:55.080
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:55.080 --> 00:01:56.160
- [Kelly] Have you seen an alien?

00:01:56.160 --> 00:01:57.750
Have you ever had an experience?

00:01:57.750 --> 00:02:00.450
- This is gonna sound so out
there, but just bear with me.

00:02:00.450 --> 00:02:04.770
So, I woke up in my room
and there was three beings,

00:02:04.770 --> 00:02:06.420
and then-

00:02:06.420 --> 00:02:07.384
- No.

00:02:07.384 --> 00:02:08.820
They were like, do you
wanna see your planet?

00:02:08.820 --> 00:02:11.640
And I was like, (beep) oh, sorry. Sorry.

00:02:11.640 --> 00:02:13.080
- You were like, hell yeah.

00:02:13.080 --> 00:02:15.638
- I was like, hell yeah, let's go.

00:02:15.638 --> 00:02:19.410
So, I whooshed out of my room,

00:02:19.410 --> 00:02:21.120
and was hovering over the planet.

00:02:21.120 --> 00:02:22.710
And then all of a sudden they were like,

00:02:22.710 --> 00:02:23.700
you wanna see our planet?

00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:24.840
And I was like,

00:02:24.840 --> 00:02:26.616
hell yeah.
- [Kelly] Hell, yes.

00:02:26.616 --> 00:02:27.690
(audience laugh)

00:02:27.690 --> 00:02:30.335
- I was totally for it.
(audience laugh)

00:02:30.335 --> 00:02:32.530
You know what I'm saying?
- You said, hell yes.

00:02:32.530 --> 00:02:33.900
(both laugh)

00:02:33.900 --> 00:02:35.850
So, I can't call it like an abduction.

00:02:35.850 --> 00:02:38.640
I called it an astral
projection for a long time,

00:02:38.640 --> 00:02:40.380
'cause I went somewhere else.
- Yeah.

00:02:40.380 --> 00:02:42.030
But then I realized maybe this was just

00:02:42.030 --> 00:02:43.503
an encounter that I had.

00:02:44.760 --> 00:02:46.110
- [Kelly] If an alien came down,

00:02:46.110 --> 00:02:48.630
where would you show them
first, on Planet Earth?

00:02:48.630 --> 00:02:52.140
What would you think would
be the best representation

00:02:52.140 --> 00:02:53.550
of humanity?

00:02:53.550 --> 00:02:57.819
- No, I'd probably take an
alien to an English soccer game.

00:02:57.819 --> 00:02:58.652
- [Kelly] Really?

00:02:58.652 --> 00:03:01.050
- Yeah, because all of humanity is there.

00:03:01.050 --> 00:03:01.883
You have people-
- [Kelly] You have passion.

00:03:01.883 --> 00:03:03.117
- Being enthusiastic.
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:03:03.117 --> 00:03:06.270
- You have great athletes
showing their athleticism.

00:03:06.270 --> 00:03:07.103
- [Kelly] Okay.

00:03:07.103 --> 00:03:09.096
- You also have some knuckleheads
doing some crazy stuff.

00:03:09.096 --> 00:03:09.929
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:03:09.929 --> 00:03:10.800
- I think that's a-
- That's a good variety.

00:03:10.800 --> 00:03:12.393
- Pretty good petri dish
of humanity right there.

00:03:12.393 --> 00:03:14.070
- That was a good answer.

00:03:14.070 --> 00:03:15.096
- Thank you.
- That's a great answer.

00:03:15.096 --> 00:03:16.546
- Thank you.
- [Kelly] Okay.

